 disabledstateid="4" id="3"/><textbuttonstyle showbg="1" showoutline="1" basestyleid="13" rollstyleid="13" downstyleid="13" selectedstyleid="13" disabledstyleid="13" basestateid="7" rollstateid="8" downstateid="9" selectedstateid="9" disabledstateid="10" id="4"/></textbuttonstyles><creditsdialogdata bodystyleid="15" titlestyleid="14"><dialogtitle>&lt;html&gt;Créditos&lt;/html&gt;</dialogtitle><text>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Música del mundo&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Dorling Kindersley/Dorling Kindersley/Dorling Kindersley/Dorling Kindersley/Dorling Kindersley/Dorling Kindersley/Dorling Kindersley/Dorling Kindersley/Dorling Kindersley/Shrine to Music Museum at the University of South Dakota/Dorling Kindersley/Dorling Kindersley/Dorling Kindersley/Dorling Kindersley&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Guitarra de blues&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Redferns/David Redfern&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&quot;Roadhouse Blues&quot; (Albert King) Parker Music (BMI) de Albert King: Blues at Sunrise (Cat. # SCD-8546-2) (p) 1988 Fantasy, Inc. Reservados todos los derechos.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Arpa de Veracruz&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;© 1988 Music of the World Ltd./Lorraine Tipaldi&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&quot;La Bamba&quot; de Los Pregoneros del Puerto: Música de Mexico y Colombia (Cat. # T-113) (p) 1988 Music of the World, Ltd. Reservados todos los derechos.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Saxofón de jazz&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;THE BETTMANN ARCHIVE/UPI&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&quot;St. Thomas&quot; (Sonny Rollins) Prestige Music (BMI) de Sonny Rollins: Saxophone Colossus (Cat. # OJCCD-291-2) Prestige Records bajo licencia a Fantasy, Inc. Reservados todos los derechos.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Banjo de bluegrass&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Photo Researchers, Inc./Arthur Tress&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&quot;Sally Ann/Sally Goodin&quot; de Snuffy Jenkins on American Banjo: Three Finger and Scruggs Style (Cat. # CD SF 40037) (p) 1990 Smithsonian/Folkways Recordings. Reservados todos los derechos.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;La flauta de Pan&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Kevin Healy&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&quot;Sicuriada&quot; de Music of the Andes and Argentina (Cat. # T-112) (p) 1988 Music of the World, Ltd. Reservados todos los derechos&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Tambores metálicos de Trinidad y Tobago&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Bruce Coleman, Inc./Denise Cupen&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&quot;Dollar&quot; Red Stripe Ebony Steel Band: de Fire and Steel: Various Steelbands (Cat. # WCD-032) (p) 1992 World Circuit. Reservados todos los derechos.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Congas caribeñas&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;ACE Records/Dave Peabody&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&quot;Arturo Pa Monte&quot; (F. Ulloa) de Francisco Ulloa: Ultramerengue (Cat. # CDORBD 080) (p) 1992 Globestyle/ACE Records, Ltd. Reservados todos los derechos.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Kora de Gambia&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;© 1993 Music of the World Ltd./Claudia Helms&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&quot;Jula Faso&quot; de Amadu Bansang Jobarteh: Tabara (Cat. # CDT-129) (p) 1992 Rakumi Records-Music of the World, Ltd. Reservados todos los derechos.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Tama de África occidental&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Dorling Kindersley&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Dagagne interpretada por Abdoulaye Diop, Magatte Fall, y Mapate, de Sabar Wolof: Dance Drumming of Senegal (Cat.# VP-1003) (c) y (p)1992 Village Pulse. Todos los derechos reservados.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Mbira de Zimbabue&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Dorling Kindersley&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&quot;Chaminuka&quot; (Dumisani Maraire) Owl&apos;s Head Publishing Co. (BMI) de Dumisani Maraire: Chaminuka: Music of Zimbabwe (Cat. # CDC-208) (p) 1989 Music of the World, Ltd. Reservados todos los derechos&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Ûd egipcio&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Dorling Kindersley&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&quot;Mwashah&quot; (Hamza A. El Din) Nubiana Pulishing Co. de Hamza El Din: Eclipse (Cat. # RCD 10103) (p) 1991 Rykodisc, Inc. Reservados todos los derechos.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Santour iraní&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Photo Researchers, Inc./Mandolin Brothers&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&quot;Avaz of Bayate Esfahan&quot; de Classical Music of Iran: The Dastgah Systems (Cat. # CD SF 40039) (p) 1991 Smithsonian Folkways Records. Reservados todos los derechos.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Acordeón europeo&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Dorling Kindersley&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&quot;Acordeón&quot; de Instrumentos del mundo (Cat. # LDX 274 675) (p) 1990 Le Chant du Monde. Reservados todos los derechos.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Gaita escocesa&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Corbis/Peter Turnley&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&quot;Balmoral Castle&quot; de Scottish Bagpipe Tunes (Cat. # Folkways FG 3550) (p) 1961 Smithsonian/Folkways Recordings. Reservados todos los derechos.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Balalaica rusa&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Dorling Kindersley&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Podruzhka Moya de Sigrai, Vanya/ Play, Vanya (Cat.# PAN 2002CD) (p)1991 Pan Records. Todos los derechos reservados.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Sitâr indio&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Dorling Kindersley&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&quot;Raga Palas Kafi&quot; de Ravi Shankar/Ali Akbar Khan: Ragas (Cat. # FCD-24714-2) (p) 1973 Fantasy, Inc. Reservados todos los derechos.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Qin de China&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Dorling Kindersley&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&quot;Liushui&quot; de China: The Art of the Qin (Cat. # C 560001) (p) 1990 Ocora/Radio France. Reservados todos los derechos.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Khen de&lt;br&gt;Tailandia&lt;br&gt; y Laos&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;ACE Records/Ben Mandelson&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&quot;Khen deum&quot; de Laos: Lam Saravane (Cat. # C 559058) (p) 1989 Ocora-Radio France. Reservados todos los derechos.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Bonang indonesio&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;© 1988 Music of the World Ltd.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&quot;Ladrang Sri Kondur&quot; de The Sultan&apos;s Pleasure: From the Palace of Yogyakarta (Cat. # T-116) (p) 1989 Music of the World, Ltd. Reservados todos los derechos.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Taiko japonés&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;The Image Works/R. Lord&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&quot;Yuudachi (Evening Rainstorm)&quot; interpretado por Soh Daiko, del CD &apos;Sakura&apos; (Cat.# Smithsonian SFW40509). Reservados todos los derechos.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Didjeridu australiano&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Bruce Coleman, Inc./Fotoconcept&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&quot;Kwa (Dance of the Crows)&quot; performed by Ash Dargan, didgeridoo, from Corroboree-Do (Traditional Ceremonial Didj Dance) (Cat.# Indigenous Australia IA2048D) ©and(p)Indigenous Australia. Reservados todos los derechos.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Zanfonía francesa&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;The Image Works/DeRichemond&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&quot;Bouree de Thiers et de Saint-Gervais&quot; de Les Brayauds: Musiques de Basse-Auvergne (Cat. # C 559083) (p) 1989 Ocora-Radio France. Reservados todos los derechos.&lt;/html&gt;</text></creditsdialogdata><colors><color r="137" g="51" b="204" id="1"/><color r="142" g="142" b="142" id="2"/><color r="255" g="255" b="255" id="3"/><color r="224" g="224" b="228" id="4"/><color r="160" g="160" b="164" id="5"/><color r="0" g="0" b="0" id="6"/><color r="227" g="227" b="227" id="7"/><color r="198" g="198" b="198" id="8"/><color r="128" g="128" b="128" id="9"/><color r="50" g="50" b="50" id="10"/><color r="90" g="16" b="148" id="11"/><color r="224" g="88" b="21" id="12"/><color r="234" g="145" b="35" id="13"/><color r="73" g="67" b="57" id="14"/><color r="150" g="150" b="150" id="15"/><color r="207" g="207" b="207" id="16"/><color r="252" g="87" b="26" id="17"/><color r="255" g="151" b="0" id="18"/><color r="255" g="116" b="0" id="19"/><color r="250" g="208" b="54" id="20"/><color r="242" g="25" b="20" id="21"/><color r="182" g="51" b="204" id="22"/></colors><twocolorbuttonstates><tcbuttonstate outlinecolorid="6" bgcolorid="3" graphiccolorid="12" id="1"/><tcbuttonstate outlinecolorid="6" bgcolorid="3" graphiccolorid="13" id="2"/><tcbuttonstate outlinecolorid="6" bgcolorid="3" graphiccolorid="10" id="3"/><tcbuttonstate outlinecolorid="14" bgcolorid="15" graphiccolorid="10" 